   $q$Which sentence does NOT help support the author's point about owls helping farmers?$q$, $q$[{"text":"\"Owls hunt only small animals like mice and voles.\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misjudges-relevance"},{"text":"\"Barn owls also have pale, heart-shaped faces that many people find beautiful.\"","is_correct":true},{"text":"\"One adult owl can eat three or four mice every night.\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misjudges-relevance"},{"text":"\"He also saw far fewer mice in his fields.\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misjudges-relevance"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$"Barn owls also have pale, heart-shaped faces that many people find beautiful."$q$, $q$How pretty an owl looks does not show that it helps a farm. The other sentences show owls eating mice, sparing other animals or reducing mice in fields.$q$, 'draft', '020df814-4c89-5f82-b161-6d50b43d7cdf')
